let drop_cap_demo_text = "Once upon a time, in a server far away, a page rendered at once and its components woke only when someone reached for them. Nobody waited for a script to arrive, nobody saw a blank page, and the form kept what had been typed in it. The people who wrote it went home early, which is the point of this story."

